From Stdlib Require Import List Bool Arith Lia.
From proofs.experiments.issue568.rocq Require Import Tableau.
From proofs.experiments.issue624.rocq Require Import SuccessorCNF.
Import ListNotations Complexity Machines Tableau SuccessorCNF.

Goal forall c, decodeConfig (state c) (length (tapeLeft c)) (flatten c) = c.
Proof. intro c. Show. apply decodeConfig_flatten. Qed.

Goal forall base states width c, span c = width -> state c < states ->
  RowRepresents (rowAssignment base states width c) base states width c.
Proof. intros. Show. apply rowAssignment_represents; assumption. Qed.
